Extend Apple's availability generator input through macOS 26.5.

Source: AvailabilityVersions-157.2 (149b1777f3e8c2133042d8e188f72e3adf6a7110),
availability.dsl. Scope: macOS SDK 26.5, arm64 and x86_64.

The public version table stops at 14.3, leaving the maximum version and XNU
symbol aliases incomplete. Extend the staging copy with Apple's release
history, including the Xcode-documented 16.0 compatibility number. The
release references accompany the added rows below. Both Apple generators
consume this staged DSL.

Evidence: tests/installed_headers/macos_26_5_availability.c and
.agents/skills/review-macos-c-sdk/scripts/sdk_review/headers/data/macosx26.5/ranked-header-differences.md.

--- a/availability.dsl
+++ b/availability.dsl
@@ -341,3 +341,32 @@
